WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
This engineering blueprint follows one
payment test from an approved contract

00:00:04.053 --> 00:00:08.800
to inspectable evidence.
The proposed stack uses Java services,

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:13.360
a real database, existing test frameworks
and a controlled provider model.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.640
AI participates
in authoring and diagnosis.

00:00:16.738 --> 00:00:21.360
Deterministic assertions establish what
happened to the transfer and journal.

00:00:21.627 --> 00:00:26.480
We will inspect the interfaces,
execution lifecycle and failure behavior.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.040
This is an authored reference
architecture to validate

00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:31.920
with the client,
not a deployed system claim.
